    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/955dfe08ea90deae53dbfc94d2f58bcc.poster.avif?t=1747208851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/955dfe08ea90deae53dbfc94d2f58bcc.webm?t=1747208851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/955dfe08ea90deae53dbfc94d2f58bcc.mp4?t=1747208851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/393b4b899ad79755fcbaedfab569518f.poster.avif?t=1747208851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/393b4b899ad79755fcbaedfab569518f.webm?t=1747208851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/393b4b899ad79755fcbaedfab569518f.mp4?t=1747208851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u300aCyberMaid\u300b\u2014 Your Personal Maid, Always by Your Side!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>The Cutest Desktop Maid to Brighten Up Your PC!</strong> \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to make your desktop more fun and lively? <i>CyberMaid</i> is a charming interactive desktop application. Your personal maid will always keep an eye on your mouse movements, providing a sense of companionship and making your work and gaming moments more relaxing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf39 Main Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Adorable Eye-Tracking:</strong> Her eyes will follow your mouse movements, making you feel her attention!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Easy and Fun Interactions:</strong> Click on specific parts of her to trigger cute reactions and discover more surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Perfect for These Users:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Fans of anime characters and maid culture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Students, office workers, and streamers who want desktop companionship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Gamers who love customizing their desktop with aesthetics and fun</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Controls \ud83c\udfae</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Left Mouse Button: Drag the maid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Double Left Click: Open settings menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Right Mouse Button: Interact with the maid to trigger cute reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa1 Mouse Wheel: Adjust the maid's distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Hold and drag the Middle Mouse Button: Switch to 360-degree free view (see her from any angle you like!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 About Updates and Game Growth \ud83d\udca1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CyberMaid is a project that will gradually grow over time.<br>We will continue to bring detailed optimizations and new features to make her increasingly close to your life and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players who have purchased the game will receive these updates for free.<br>We hope this is not just a game, but a small daily companion that can accompany you for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, if there are large-scale content expansions, the price may be adjusted.<br>This will be to make the work more complete and more worthy of long-term collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you've just met her or say good morning to her every day,<br>we cherish this companionship and will strive to make her better and better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for placing her on your desktop and making her a small part of your life.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/955dfe08ea90deae53dbfc94d2f58bcc.poster.avif?t=1747208851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/955dfe08ea90deae53dbfc94d2f58bcc.webm?t=1747208851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/955dfe08ea90deae53dbfc94d2f58bcc.mp4?t=1747208851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/393b4b899ad79755fcbaedfab569518f.poster.avif?t=1747208851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/393b4b899ad79755fcbaedfab569518f.webm?t=1747208851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584720/extras/393b4b899ad79755fcbaedfab569518f.mp4?t=1747208851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u300aCyberMaid\u300b\u2014 Your Personal Maid, Always by Your Side!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>The Cutest Desktop Maid to Brighten Up Your PC!</strong> \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to make your desktop more fun and lively? <i>CyberMaid</i> is a charming interactive desktop application. Your personal maid will always keep an eye on your mouse movements, providing a sense of companionship and making your work and gaming moments more relaxing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf39 Main Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Adorable Eye-Tracking:</strong> Her eyes will follow your mouse movements, making you feel her attention!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Easy and Fun Interactions:</strong> Click on specific parts of her to trigger cute reactions and discover more surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Perfect for These Users:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Fans of anime characters and maid culture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Students, office workers, and streamers who want desktop companionship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Gamers who love customizing their desktop with aesthetics and fun</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Controls \ud83c\udfae</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Left Mouse Button: Drag the maid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Double Left Click: Open settings menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Right Mouse Button: Interact with the maid to trigger cute reactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa1 Mouse Wheel: Adjust the maid's distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Hold and drag the Middle Mouse Button: Switch to 360-degree free view (see her from any angle you like!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 About Updates and Game Growth \ud83d\udca1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CyberMaid is a project that will gradually grow over time.<br>We will continue to bring detailed optimizations and new features to make her increasingly close to your life and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players who have purchased the game will receive these updates for free.<br>We hope this is not just a game, but a small daily companion that can accompany you for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, if there are large-scale content expansions, the price may be adjusted.<br>This will be to make the work more complete and more worthy of long-term collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you've just met her or say good morning to her every day,<br>we cherish this companionship and will strive to make her better and better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for placing her on your desktop and making her a small part of your life.</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udc96 Touchable, bouncing boobs! CyberMaid \u2013 Your sexy desktop maid! With real-time physics, you can grab, jiggle, and enjoy her soft reactions. She stays on your screen, always there to spice up work, study, or chill time with fun, charm, and just the right amount of bounce.",
